Added :meth:`FreeBusy.from_availability <icalendar.cal.free_busy.FreeBusy.from_availability>` and :func:`icalendar.cal.free_busy.compute_free_busy_intervals` to compute a ready-to-send ``VFREEBUSY`` component for a query window from ``VAVAILABILITY``/``AVAILABLE`` components as specified in :rfc:`7953`, combining components by ``PRIORITY`` and ``BUSYTYPE``, overlaying actual busy periods, and interpreting floating times in an explicitly given timezone.
